{
  "name": "Session",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "event_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID do evento"
    },
    "track_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID da trilha"
    },
    "room_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID da sala"
    },
    "title": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "T\u00edtulo da sess\u00e3o"
    },
    "description": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Descri\u00e7\u00e3o"
    },
    "speaker_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID do palestrante (Participant)"
    },
    "speaker_name": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Nome do palestrante"
    },
    "start_time": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time"
    },
    "end_time": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time"
    },
    "capacity": {
      "type": "number"
    },
    "presence_count": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0,
      "description": "Item 2 (2026-10-09) \u2014 Gate at\u00f4mico de capacidade das presen\u00e7as. Claim de vaga via updateMany condicional ({id, presence_count: {$lt: capacity}}, {$inc: +1}) \u2014 exatamente um vencedor por vaga em corrida (mesma primitiva CAS do checkout_lock/voted_person_ids). Decrementado condicionalmente no unregister (transi\u00e7\u00e3o present\u2192false) e na compensa\u00e7\u00e3o de dedup/falha de create. Sess\u00f5es legadas sem o campo recebem backfill lazy na primeira inscri\u00e7\u00e3o (contagem de SessionAttendance is_present=true, CAS sobre null \u2014 que casa com campo ausente). null/0 em capacity = sem limite (gate n\u00e3o usado)."
    },
    "session_type": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "aula",
        "debate",
        "demonstracao",
        "keynote",
        "mesa_redonda",
        "palestra",
        "painel",
        "simulacao",
        "workshop"
      ],
      "default": "palestra"
    },
    "material_url": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL do material da sess\u00e3o (arquivo/link)"
    },
    "submission_id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "ID da Submission que originou esta sess\u00e3o (v\u00ednculo bilateral CFP)"
    },
    "is_deleted": {
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "event_id",
    "title"
  ],
  "rls": {
    "read": {
      "user_condition": {
        "role": "admin"
      }
    },
    "create": {
      "user_condition": {
        "role": "admin"
      }
    },
    "update": {
      "user_condition": {
        "role": "admin"
      }
    },
    "delete": {
      "user_condition": {
        "role": "admin"
      }
    }
  }
}